{
  "_readme": [
    "A SEED FIXTURE, not a design. It is the compact dump scripts/figma-fetch.snippet.js",
    "returns, hand-written to exercise every rule in the transform: a two-mode collection,",
    "a Semantic collection whose names already carry colour/, single-mode collections that",
    "land in both outputs, the Fonts raw-layer exclusions, unitless weights, and a type",
    "role pair that derives fluid-type companions.",
    "",
    "It exists so `npm test` is green on a fresh clone and so the whole sync chain can be",
    "proved without opening Figma: `npm run seed` regenerates tokens/ from this file.",
    "",
    "The VALUES are deliberately characterless greys and one blue. This template",
    "commoditises setup, never design judgement — the moment it ships opinions about what",
    "tokens should exist, it has become the thing the manifesto refuses. A client's first",
    "sync replaces all of it.",
    "",
    "Shape: c = [[collectionId, name, [[modeId, modeName], ...]], ...]",
    "       v = [[variableName, collectionIndex, typeIndex, ...valuesInModeOrder], ...]",
    "       typeIndex: 0 = COLOR, 1 = FLOAT, 2 = STRING"
  ],
